                            {
                                "example_id": "01031946-045c-4e00-aa7c-febb4a4301ca",
                                "sense_id": "f913dc31-3363-3c3b-acc1-29b0a6c7b600",
                                "text": "Но куда́, что звало́ и му́чило его́ и кто бро́сил э́тот невыноси́мый пла́мень, души́вший, пожира́вший всю кровь его́? — он опя́ть не знал и не по́мнил.",
                                "translation": "But to what end, what led him on and tortured him, and who had kindled this terrible flame that stifled him and consumed his blood, again he did not know and could not remember.",
                                "english": "But to what end, what led him on and tortured him, and who had kindled this terrible flame that stifled him and consumed his blood, again he did not know and could not remember."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
